    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/creative-one-page/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Creative One Page is a modern, sleek, and multipurpose theme designed for creative professionals, digital agencies, freelancers, startups, portfolio websites, corporate firms, and small businesses. Ideal for showcasing services, projects, portfolios, team members, client testimonials, business highlights, interactive banners, pricing tables, and FAQs, the theme provides a seamless one-page browsing experience with call-to-action (CTA) buttons and visually engaging sections. Fully responsive, mobile-friendly, and retina-ready, it ensures your website looks stunning across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Built with optimized, secure code, it guarantees fast loading times, smooth navigation, and SEO-friendly performance. Customization is effortless with flexible options for layouts, colors, fonts, and sections, allowing businesses to create a unique and branded online presence. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for online product or service sales, Contact Form 7 for inquiries and lead generation, and WPML for multilingual support, Creative One Page delivers a professional, feature-rich, and visually appealing solution for creative and business websites. Demo: https://preview.themescaliber.com/creative-one-page-pro/"
    },
